# The same status is not notified twice: WARNING, UNDEFINED (an internal status), WARNING again (not sent, with its
# record), UNDEFINED, then CLEAR (sent: the last notified status was WARNING).
database real
rules tests/corpus/notify/dedup.conf
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
var loop.n v 10
clock 0
pass 0
var loop.n v 60
clock 1
pass 1
var loop.n v 80
clock 2
pass 2
var loop.n v 90
clock 3
pass 3
var loop.n v 80
clock 4
pass 4
var loop.n v 10
clock 5
pass 5
clock 6
alarm-log 0
